# =============================================================================
# Per-Dockerfile ignore for process-management/Dockerfile.api
#
# The build context is the repo root (jxt-evidence-system/), but this Dockerfile
# only ever COPYs the process-management/ tree. The repo-root .dockerignore is
# tuned for the jxt-benchmark build and explicitly excludes process-management/,
# which would otherwise empty this build's context.
#
# BuildKit gives <Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore precedence over the root
# .dockerignore, so here we re-include the process-management/ tree (tests/
# included, since go.work references ./tests and the build runs in workspace
# mode) and keep every unrelated sibling excluded to keep the context small.
# The jxt-benchmark build is untouched — it still uses the root .dockerignore.
# =============================================================================

# Exclude everything under the repo root ...
*
# ... then re-include only the process-management tree.
!process-management
!process-management/**

# Universal cruft inside the included tree (never needed to compile).
process-management/.git
process-management/**/.git/
process-management/**/node_modules/
